name: ['A Good Thing', 'Abian, Luvion Usurper', 'Aggressive Crag', 'Animate Spell', 'Banding Sliver', 'Baneslayer Aspirant', "Barry's Land", "Bear with Set's Mechanic", 'Bind // Liberate', 'Biting Remark', 'Blood Poet', 'Bombardment', 'Bone Rattler', 'Bucket List', 'Buried Ogre', 'Celestine Cave Witch', 'Chimney Goyf', 'Chronobot', 'Command the Chaff', 'Control Win Condition', 'Corrupted Key', 'Cyclopean Titan', 'Do-Over', 'Domesticated Mammoth', 'Domesticated Watercourse', 'Enchanted Prairie', 'Enchantmentize', 'Enroll in the Coalition', 'Everlasting Lich', 'Evil Boros Charm', 'Experiment Five', 'Five Kids in a Trenchcoat', 'Form of the Mulldrifter', 'Frenemy of the Guildpact', 'Frogkin Kidnapper', 'Frontier Explorer', 'Generated Horizons', 'Geometric Weird', 'Gold Mine', 'Golgari Death Swarm', 'Gorilla Tactics', 'Graveyard Dig', 'Growth Charm', 'Gunk Slug', 'High Troller', 'How to Keep an Izzet Mage Busy', 'Imaginary Friends', 'Impatient Iguana', 'Innocuous Insect', 'Inspirational Antelope', 'Interplanar Brushwagg', 'Jasconian Isle', 'Kaya, Ghost Haunter', 'Khod, Etlan Shiis Envoy', 'Krosan Adaptation', 'Lantern of Undersight', 'Largepox', 'Lazier Goblin', 'Learned Learner', 'Lightning Colt', 'Loopy Lobster', 'Louvaq, the Aberrant', 'Mana Abundance', "Maro's Gone Nuts", 'Memory Bank', 'Metagamer', 'Mirrored Lotus', 'Noxious Bayou', 'One with Death', 'Patient Turtle', 'Personal Decoy', 'Pick Your Poison', 'Pithing Spyglass', 'Plane-Merge Elf', 'Planequake', 'Priority Avenger', 'Problematic Volcano', 'Puresteel Angel', 'Queue of Beetles', "Ral's Vanguard", 'Recycla-bird', 'Red Herring', 'Rift', 'Ruff, Underdog Champ', "Sarah's Wings", 'Scaled Destruction', 'Seasoned Weaponsmith', "Seek Bolas's Counsel", 'Siege Elemental', 'Sliv-Mizzet, Hivemind', 'Slivdrazi Monstrosity', 'Smelt // Herd // Saw', 'Soulmates', 'Spellmorph Raise Dead', 'Squidnapper', 'Stack of Paperwork', 'Start // Fire', 'Sunimret', 'Swarm of Locus', 'Taiga Stadium', 'The Grand Tour', 'Throat Wolf', 'Tibalt the Chaotic', 'Time Sidewalk', 'Transcantation', 'Trial and Error', 'Truth or Dare', 'Underdark Beholder', 'Unicycle', 'Vazal, the Compleat', 'Visitor from Planet Q', 'Waste Land', 'Weaponized Scrap', 'Whammy Burn', 'Witty Demon', 'Wizened Arbiter', 'Wrath of Sod', 'Xyru Specter', "Yawgmoth's Testament", "You're in Command", 'Zyym, Mesmeric Lord']
